do GameManager.lock_player()
[wait time="1.5"]
do CutSceneManager.start_intro_cutscene()
do CutSceneManager.start_cutscene()
ShopMan: Hello there!
ShopMan: The fresh meat.. erm, the new rookie has arrived!
ShopMan: Pardon my manners! It's a pleasure to have you. You read the advertisement thoroughly...
ShopMan: DIDN'T YOU?
ShopMan: Yes... of course you did! I only hire the cream of the crop! Except for the last rookie... and the one before that... Erm, never mind!
ShopMan: Just glad to have a fresh soul interested in the extermination business. It's a dying trade, you know!
ShopMan: Now, listen, kid. We've got a town crawling with the killer mutant rats you've been hearing about in the papers. It's our job to clean 'em out. The other exterminators were too scared to show their faces, but we ain't afraid - as long as the pay is right!
do CutSceneManager.return_player_to_home_during_cutscene()
[wait time="0.5"]
do CutSceneManager.play_merchant_talk_3()
ShopMan: Oh! Didn't mean to scare ya!
ShopMan: Don't run off just yet! Think of this as a training exercise. Survive - erm, complete the job successfully - and you'll be a bonafide Exterminator!
ShopMan: Now, this here is our base of operations. The Hub, for short!
do CutSceneManager.show_controls_label()
ShopMan: Use WASD to rotate between the four cardinal directions. Click my shop cart to purchase weapon upgrades, or turn left to visit the Character Campfire. That's where you can spend Ability Points earned from leveling up to grow stronger!
[wait time="0.7"]
do CutSceneManager.move_player_to_campfire_during_cutscene()
[wait time="0.7"]
ShopMan: At the Character Campfire, you can use your Ability Points you acquire from Leveling your experience to become stronger and wipe those rats out even more efficiently than before!
do CutSceneManager.move_player_to_cart_during_cutscene()
[wait time="1.0"]
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutSceneManager.show_start_battle_label()
do CutSceneManager.play_merchant_talk_2()
ShopMan: When you're ready to fight, press R, select a wave, and get to exterminatin'!
ShopMan: That's about it!
ShopMan: ...Oh? Why aren't I joining you?
ShopMan: Well, someone's gotta watch the car! Besides, there's nothing like a good trial by fire to whip a rookie into shape.
do CutSceneManager.play_merchant_talk_1()
ShopMan: Good luck out there, kid! You're gonna need it!
do CutSceneManager.show_hub_hud()
[wait time="1.0"]
do GameManager.unlock_player()
do CutSceneManager.end_cutscene()